        "clube_oferta_limpo": "Nato looks you over. \"You're clean with me. But I got a job: betting pit, mine. You go in, you win, you walk with 200 in hand. No experience — nobody learns anything in the pit. You lose, we patch you up and you try again. Only the buy-in's on credit: I heal you now and it turns into debt if you don't win. Deal?\"",
